    "notes": "Rust Dedicated Server public build 25353106 (2026-09-16) with Carbon production build v2.0.259 (protocol 2026.09.03.0, commit 21063e8, GitHub release asset id 547241271). Compile/load, identify, reachability, catalogues, console, broadcast, reconnect and shutdown are proven by takaro-maint verify with no client; player hooks and gameplay are not. Carbon's production_build tag is re-uploaded in place, so what pins these bytes is the recorded sha256/size, not the tag. Carbon publishes no machine-readable Rust-build compatibility, so a new Rust head is filed blocked-upstream until a target pinning a compatible Carbon lands. Runtime CI is #167; gameplay evidence #174."
  },
